Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.67,0:00:05.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我就是白河同学的…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.88,0:00:06.88,Default,,0,0,0,,男朋友!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.84,0:00:12.59,Default,,0,0,0,,啥?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.59,0:00:13.85,Default,,0,0,0,,他在说什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.18,0:00:15.81,Default,,0,0,0,,这怎么可能
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.31,0:00:18.35,Default,,0,0,0,,人家说了那种话喔
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.69,0:00:20.73,Default,,0,0,0,,是真的喔
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.73,0:00:21.52,Default,,0,0,0,,咦?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.86,0:00:26.07,Default,,0,0,0,,这太扯了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.07,0:00:28.32,Default,,0,0,0,,居然跟加岛那种人交往
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.32,0:00:30.28,Default,,0,0,0,,白河同学人根本超好的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.65,0:00:32.95,Default,,0,0,0,,白河同学果然是天使
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.95,0:00:35.53,Default,,0,0,0,,可恶  我要再告白一次
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.99,0:00:36.99,Default,,0,0,0,,也就是说
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.99,0:00:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,,她要男朋友包养她的传闻是假的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.62,0:00:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.34,0:00:55.35,Default,,0,0,0,,喂  阿加
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.39,0:01:00.35,Default,,0,0,0,,黑濑同学
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.10,0:01:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你不要过来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.85,0:01:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,散布白河同学传闻的人
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.61,0:01:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,是黑濑同学对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.90,0:01:09.15,Default,,0,0,0,,是的话又怎样
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.57,0:01:10.94,Default,,0,0,0,,你愿意告诉我吗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.49,0:01:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你为什么要做那种事
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.37,0:01:17.16,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我想当第一
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.49,0:01:21.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我…不想再被那女人夺走任何东西了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.62,0:01:22.29,Default,,0,0,0,,咦?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.83,0:01:24.33,Default,,0,0,0,,白河月爱是…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.63,0:01:26.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我的双胞胎姊姊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.75,0:01:27.67,Default,,0,0,0,,咦?
Comment: 0,0:01:29.84,0:01:31.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Love You Love You
Comment: 0,0:01:31.09,0:01:34.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Love You Tender!
Comment: 0,0:01:47.27,0:01:50.73,Default,,0,0,0,,咦? 总觉得我好奇怪
Comment: 0,0:01:50.73,0:01:53.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我从没有过 这样的感觉
Comment: 0,0:01:53.24,0:01:56.57,Default,,0,0,0,,每当感受到你的温柔 为什么呢?
Comment: 0,0:01:56.57,0:01:59.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我的胸口就会感到难受
Comment: 0,0:02:00.41,0:02:01.91,Default,,0,0,0,,相互交叠
Comment: 0,0:02:01.91,0:02:03.75,Default,,0,0,0,,逐渐混合
Comment: 0,0:02:03.75,0:02:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,已经无论如何都无法停止了(无法!)
Comment: 0,0:02:06.50,0:02:09.67,Default,,0,0,0,,被烟火的光线给照亮的
Comment: 0,0:02:09.67,0:02:12.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你的侧脸
Comment: 0,0:02:14.68,0:02:15.18,Default,,0,0,0,,LaLaLa
Comment: 0,0:02:15.18,0:02:16.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Love You Love You
Comment: 0,0:02:16.51,0:02:18.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Love You Tender!
Comment: 0,0:02:18.51,0:02:20.93,Default,,0,0,0,,人家正盯着你呢
Comment: 0,0:02:20.93,0:02:23.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我讨厌暧昧 待在我身边
Comment: 0,0:02:23.93,0:02:26.48,Default,,0,0,0,,(一直一直 待在我身边)
Comment: 0,0:02:26.48,0:02:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,LaLaLa
Comment: 0,0:02:27.02,0:02:28.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Love You Love You
Comment: 0,0:02:28.36,0:02:30.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Love You Tender!
Comment: 0,0:02:30.11,0:02:32.61,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是恋爱吧
Comment: 0,0:02:32.61,0:02:35.61,Default,,0,0,0,,是你让我了解这感觉的
Comment: 0,0:02:35.61,0:02:38.37,Default,,0,0,0,,(这是你带给我的感觉)
Comment: 0,0:02:38.37,0:02:40.03,Default,,0,0,0,,对象是我真的可以吗?
Comment: 0,0:02:40.03,0:02:41.45,Default,,0,0,0,,(对象是我真的可以吗?)
Comment: 0,0:02:41.45,0:02:44.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知所措又无法更进一步 真是的…
Comment: 0,0:02:44.29,0:02:47.29,Default,,0,0,0,,忐忑不安又闪闪发光的现在
Comment: 0,0:02:47.29,0:02:50.29,Default,,0,0,0,,逐渐染上可爱色彩的世界
Comment: 0,0:02:50.29,0:02:52.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Love You Tender!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.51,0:03:01.01,Default,,0,0,0,,双  双胞胎?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.47,0:03:02.64,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是真的吧
Comment: 0,0:03:02.74,0:03:09.75,Default,,0,0,0,,
